# Serbian shares Croatian's idiom: a bare genitive-plural "dana"/"дана" (of
# days) trailing a year/month/week count is the emphatic filler "mesec
# DANA" (literally "a month OF DAYS" == exactly one month), never a genuine
# extra day -- a standalone "+1 day" reads the nominative "dan"/"дан", not
# this genitive-plural form.  Wiktionary, dan, Serbo-Croatian declension
# table (genitive plural "dana"). https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dan#Serbo-Croatian
dana
дана
